    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/f174e1a614c169a4274b597f58d0e998.poster.avif?t=1744300732\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/f174e1a614c169a4274b597f58d0e998.webm?t=1744300732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/f174e1a614c169a4274b597f58d0e998.mp4?t=1744300732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help <strong><i>Zirian</i></strong> save his sister from the claws of Despair by restoring the fabric of time and uncovering the secrets of the <strong><i>Master Clockmakers</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/18b245d3b5d7d99fd73a63e1207e7236.avif?t=1744300732\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stunning realms shaped by the <strong><i>Master Clockmakers</i></strong>, each f<i>illed with mystery, magic, breathtaking vistas</i>, and endearing characters. Navigate ethereal forests, underwater realms, sunlit dunes and cloudy heights - the world of <strong><i>Duskfade</i></strong> is alive and teems with secrets for you to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/614bb3b525b680862989bb53b96ec421.poster.avif?t=1744300732\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/614bb3b525b680862989bb53b96ec421.webm?t=1744300732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/614bb3b525b680862989bb53b96ec421.mp4?t=1744300732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/b92191fe80e1993d3cb7517970f0ad96.avif?t=1744300732\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a seamless blend of <i>dynamic platforming and fast-paced combat</i>. Jump, dash, grapple, and glide your way through thrilling challenges that rekindle the magic of classic action platformer favourites.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/4c76b25d8c8275eb2d88525fee6f2155.poster.avif?t=1744300732\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/4c76b25d8c8275eb2d88525fee6f2155.webm?t=1744300732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/4c76b25d8c8275eb2d88525fee6f2155.mp4?t=1744300732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/aa06400b348c289bebffc3f8b4a3f700.avif?t=1744300732\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Experience a powerful coming-of-age journey filled with heart</i>, loss, and the courage to face the unknown. Join a cast of charming characters to face down long forgotten foes, each embodying an emotional hurdle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/3b3748ccbf203513877e725fd9eb4c8b.poster.avif?t=1744300732\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/3b3748ccbf203513877e725fd9eb4c8b.webm?t=1744300732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/3b3748ccbf203513877e725fd9eb4c8b.mp4?t=1744300732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/f174e1a614c169a4274b597f58d0e998.poster.avif?t=1744300732\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/f174e1a614c169a4274b597f58d0e998.webm?t=1744300732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/f174e1a614c169a4274b597f58d0e998.mp4?t=1744300732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help <strong><i>Zirian</i></strong> save his sister from the claws of Despair by restoring the fabric of time and uncovering the secrets of the <strong><i>Master Clockmakers</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/18b245d3b5d7d99fd73a63e1207e7236.avif?t=1744300732\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stunning realms shaped by the <strong><i>Master Clockmakers</i></strong>, each f<i>illed with mystery, magic, breathtaking vistas</i>, and endearing characters. Navigate ethereal forests, underwater realms, sunlit dunes and cloudy heights - the world of <strong><i>Duskfade</i></strong> is alive and teems with secrets for you to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/614bb3b525b680862989bb53b96ec421.poster.avif?t=1744300732\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/614bb3b525b680862989bb53b96ec421.webm?t=1744300732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/614bb3b525b680862989bb53b96ec421.mp4?t=1744300732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/b92191fe80e1993d3cb7517970f0ad96.avif?t=1744300732\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a seamless blend of <i>dynamic platforming and fast-paced combat</i>. Jump, dash, grapple, and glide your way through thrilling challenges that rekindle the magic of classic action platformer favourites.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/4c76b25d8c8275eb2d88525fee6f2155.poster.avif?t=1744300732\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/4c76b25d8c8275eb2d88525fee6f2155.webm?t=1744300732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/4c76b25d8c8275eb2d88525fee6f2155.mp4?t=1744300732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/aa06400b348c289bebffc3f8b4a3f700.avif?t=1744300732\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Experience a powerful coming-of-age journey filled with heart</i>, loss, and the courage to face the unknown. Join a cast of charming characters to face down long forgotten foes, each embodying an emotional hurdle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/3b3748ccbf203513877e725fd9eb4c8b.poster.avif?t=1744300732\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/3b3748ccbf203513877e725fd9eb4c8b.webm?t=1744300732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/3b3748ccbf203513877e725fd9eb4c8b.mp4?t=1744300732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "short_description": "Shatter the shackles of time as you jump, swing, and slash through a fantastic world in this love letter to classic 3D action platformers. Zirian, accompanied by his mechanical Cuckoo, must save his sister from a mysterious Clock Tower that has plunged the land into eternal night.",
